---
title: Course collection
layout: home
description: A course — what it teaches, who it is for, the whole curriculum visible before anybody pays, and where you got to if you have already started.
eyebrow: Collections · Course
source: src/components/curriculum.css · commerce.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; --im-section-gap: 1.5rem">
	<p class="im-eyebrow">Collections · Course · {{page.title}}</p>
	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-single im-wrap-wide" data-sidebar="on" style="--im-single-aside: 21rem">
	<article class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 2rem">
		<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
			<ol class="im-breadcrumb im-breadcrumb-chevron">
				<li><a href="/">{{> "icons/house"}}<span>Home</span></a></li>
				<li><a href="/collections/course/">{{> "icons/graduation-cap"}}<span>Courses</span></a></li>
				<li><span aria-current="page">Design tokens, properly</span></li>
			</ol>
		</nav>

		<header class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 1.5rem">
			<div class="im-mediabg" style="--im-mediabg-min: 18rem">
				<img src="{{demo.shots.[0]}}" alt="">
				<div class="im-mediabg-scrim"></div>
				<div class="im-mediabg-copy">
					<p class="im-cinehero-meta"><span>Course</span><span>7 lessons · 81 min</span><span>2 free</span></p>
					<h1 class="im-mediabg-title">Design tokens, properly</h1>
					<p class="im-mediabg-text">The layer that decides everything else. By the end, dark mode is a change to one file — and you know why.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="im-coursehero" style="min-height: 0">
				<div class="im-video im-video-full" id="trailer" data-im-video="aqz-KE-bpKQ" data-im-video-title="Trailer">
					<img class="im-video-poster" src="{{demo.shots.[1]}}" alt="" loading="eager">
					<button class="im-video-play" type="button" aria-label="Play the trailer">{{> "icons/play"}}</button>
				</div>
				<div class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: .875rem">
					<p class="im-rating im-rating-lg" style="--im-rating: 4.8"><span class="im-rating-stars" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="im-rating-value">4.8</span><a class="im-rating-count" href="#said">41 reviews</a></p>
					<p class="im-tier-price" style="border: 0; padding: 0"><b>€49</b><span>once, yours forever · free on <a href="/pages/membership/">Workshop</a></span></p>
					<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem"><a class="im-btn im-btn-primary" href="/collections/course/lesson/">{{icon "play"}}Start the course</a><a class="im-btn" href="#curriculum">{{icon "list"}}Curriculum</a></p>
					<ul class="im-tier-list"><li>Every source file and the finished token set</li><li>Lifetime updates, 14-day refund</li><li>Two lessons free, no account needed</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<div class="im-bignums">
			<span class="im-bignum"><strong data-im-count>7</strong><span>{{icon "square-play"}}Lessons</span></span>
			<span class="im-bignum"><strong data-im-count>81</strong><small>min</small><span>{{icon "clock"}}Total</span></span>
			<span class="im-bignum"><strong data-im-count>3</strong><span>{{icon "layers"}}Sections</span></span>
			<span class="im-bignum"><strong data-im-count>1,240</strong><span>{{icon "users"}}Taken it</span></span>
			<span class="im-bignum"><strong data-im-count>4.8</strong><span>{{icon "star"}}Rated</span></span>
		</div>

		<section class="im-content im-content-flush">
			<h2>Who it is for</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Somebody who has built a theme and fought it.</strong> If you have ever changed a colour in nine places, this is the course.</li>
				<li><strong>A designer who writes CSS.</strong> You do not need a build step, a framework or a preprocessor — only a browser that understands custom properties, which all of them do.</li>
				<li><strong>Not a beginner.</strong> If you are not comfortable writing CSS by hand, start somewhere else and come back.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>What you need first</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>CSS you can read without a reference — custom properties, cascade, specificity.</li>
				<li>A text editor and a browser. Nothing is installed in this course.</li>
				<li>Optionally a Ghost install, for the last section. Everything before it is plain CSS.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="im-section" id="curriculum" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<div class="home-head"><p class="im-caption" data-index="curriculum">The curriculum</p><p class="im-hint" style="margin: 0">7 lessons · 81 minutes · 2 free</p></div>

			{{#each demo.sections}}
			<section class="im-module" aria-labelledby="mod-{{n}}">
				<header class="im-module-head">
					<span class="im-module-n" aria-hidden="true">{{n}}</span>
					<h3 class="im-module-title" id="mod-{{n}}">{{name}}</h3>
					<p class="im-module-meta"><span>{{time}}</span><span>{{when}}</span></p>
					<p class="im-module-text">{{text}}</p>
				</header>
				<ol class="im-lessons im-lessons-shots">
					{{#each ../demo.lessons}}{{#match n ">=" ../from}}{{#match n "<=" ../to}}
					<li>
						<a class="im-lesson" href="/collections/course/lesson/" data-state="{{#if locked}}locked{{else}}{{state}}{{/if}}"{{#match state "=" "current"}} aria-current="page"{{/match}}>
							<span class="im-lesson-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
							<span class="im-lesson-shot"><img src="{{lookup ../../demo.shots shot}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
							<span>{{title}}</span>
							<span class="im-lesson-kind">{{#match kind "=" "video"}}{{icon "square-play"}}Video{{else}}{{icon "file-text"}}Article{{/match}}</span>
							{{#unless locked}}{{#match n "<" "03"}}<span class="im-lesson-free">Free preview</span>{{/match}}{{/unless}}
							<small>{{time}}</small>
						</a>
					</li>
					{{/match}}{{/match}}{{/each}}
				</ol>
			</section>
			{{/each}}
		</section>

		<section class="im-section" id="said" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<h2 class="im-caption" data-index="said">What people who took it say</h2>
			<div class="im-reviews">
				{{#each demo.testimonials}}
				<article class="im-review">
					<p class="im-review-head">
						<span class="im-review-by">{{by}}</span>
						<span class="im-rating" style="--im-rating: {{rating}}"><span class="im-rating-stars" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sr-only">{{rating}} out of 5</span></span>
						<span class="im-review-verified">{{icon "circle-check"}}Took it</span>
						<time class="im-review-when">{{role}}</time>
					</p>
					<p class="im-review-text">{{text}}</p>
				</article>
				{{/each}}
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="im-section" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<h2 class="im-caption" data-index="q">Before you buy</h2>
			<div class="im-accordion">
				<details class="im-disclosure"><summary>How long do I have access?</summary><div class="im-disclosure-body"><p>Forever, including every revision. The token lesson has been rewritten twice and both rewrites were free to everybody who had already bought it.</p></div></details>
				<details class="im-disclosure"><summary>Is there a refund?</summary><div class="im-disclosure-body"><p>Fourteen days, no reason needed. Watch the whole thing first if you like — I would rather you did.</p></div></details>
				<details class="im-disclosure"><summary>Do I need Ghost?</summary><div class="im-disclosure-body"><p>Only for the last section. Everything before it is plain CSS in a browser.</p></div></details>
			</div>
		</section>
	</article>

	<aside>
		<div class="im-sticky-rail">
			<div class="im-widgets">
				<section class="im-widget im-widget-accent" aria-labelledby="c-buy">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="c-buy">Get it</h2>
					<p class="im-tier-price" style="border: 0; padding: 0"><b>€49</b><span>once, yours forever</span></p>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-primary" href="/pages/auth/" style="width: 100%">{{icon "play"}}Start the course</a>
					<p class="im-hint" style="text-align: center">Free on <a href="/pages/membership/">Workshop</a>. 14-day refund.</p>
				</section>

				<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="c-by">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="c-by">Who made it</h2>
					<div class="im-widget-author">
						{{> "components/avatar" size="lg" src=demo.author.profile_image name=demo.author.name}}
						<div>
							<p class="im-widget-author-name">{{demo.author.name}}</p>
							<p class="im-widget-author-role">Design systems · 8 years</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<p class="im-widget-sponsor">Wrote the system this course is about, and the theme on top of it. Both are in the <a href="/collections/shop/">shop</a>, and the course is how they were built.</p>
					<dl class="im-widget-facts">
						<dt>Courses</dt><dd>2</dd>
						<dt>Students</dt><dd>2,100</dd>
						<dt>Rated</dt><dd>4.8</dd>
					</dl>
					<a class="im-btn im-btn-sm" href="/pages/about/" style="width: 100%">{{icon "user"}}About me</a>
				</section>

				<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="c-inc">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="c-inc">What is included</h2>
					<ul class="im-tier-list">
						<li>7 lessons, 81 minutes</li>
						<li>Every source file</li>
						<li>The finished token set</li>
						<li>Lifetime updates</li>
						<li data-no>A certificate</li>
					</ul>
				</section>

				<section class="im-widget im-widget-fill" aria-labelledby="c-sub">
					<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="c-sub">Not sure yet</h2>
					<p class="im-widget-heading">Two lessons are free. Start there.</p>
					{{> "components/subscribe" id="course-email" button="Send them"}}
				</section>
				<aside class="im-ad im-ad-rectangle" aria-label="Advertisement">
				<span class="im-ad-label">Sponsored</span>
				<span class="im-ad-slot"><img src="{{demo.shots.[5]}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
				<button class="im-btn im-btn-sm im-ad-remove" type="button" popovertarget="ad-gate">{{icon "circle-x"}}Remove ads</button>
			</aside>
		</div>
		</div>
	</aside>
</div>

<section class="im-section im-wrap"><div class="im-prose">
<p>What it is, who made it, how much there is, what somebody who took it says — in that order. The cover is a <a href="/media/backgrounds/">media background</a>, the numbers count up (<code>data-im-count</code>), the curriculum is sections (<code>im-module</code>) with a still per lesson and the kind on every row, and the instructor is a rail widget with their own numbers.</p>
</div></section>
